iki37v_RBhZNFAgGkBv-VcYtDhlbsurvdACnyAT0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5odEP4LBJln8uHaJyvAfBW92ghNSIeT8a29m90ea1h6A&oe=6A0DB18A"}, "display_name": "PICKABOOM", "keywords": ["survival", "horror", "free", "shooting", "mining"], "long_description": "**MINE ORES. SHOOT ALIENS.**                                                                                                                                                                           \n{1992847338010690}\n\nENTER DANGEROUS CAVES, MINE VALUABLE MINERALS, AND FIGHT OFF ALIEN CREATURES TO SURVIVE.\n\n**EXPLORE MASSIVE CAVES.**\n{1277545327906163}\n\nNAVIGATE VAST UNDERGROUND ENVIRONMENTS FILLED WITH RESOURCES, HIDDEN PATHS, AND CONSTANT DANGER.\n\n**CUSTOMIZE YOUR AVATAR**\n{1000141166048660}\nCUSTOMIZE YOUR MINER WITH UNIQUE DNA BUILDS. PLACE THE ACCESSORIES WHEREVER YOU WANT!\n\n**FIGHT BOSSES.** \n{26625863637042260}\nCLAIM TREASURE. TAKE DOWN POWERFUL BOSSES DEEP UNDERGROUND AND CLAIM RARE REWARDS.\n\n**TECH TREE.**\n{1342354037946372}\nUPGRADE YOUR GEAR AND ABILITIES TO BECOME STRONGER WITH EVERY RUN.\n\n**PLAY TOGETHER.**\n{1761786788533442}\nTEAM UP WITH UP TO 11 PLAYERS AND SURVIVE THE MINES.\n\n**WELCOME TO THE MINES.**\n{1363649142273658}\nENTER A PORTAL, GO DEEPER, AND SURVIVE THE RUN.\n\n**UPDATES EVERY WEDNESDAY.**\n\nJOIN THE DISCORD \ud83d\udc49 https://discord.com/invite/pickaboom\n\n**WELCOME, MINER. CONGRATULATIONS ON JOINING PICKABOOM!** IF YOU\u2019RE A HARD WORKER, A GOOD SHOT AND A RELIABLE TEAM PLAYER, YOU SHOULD HAVE RESPECTABLE ODDS OF SURVIVAL.\n\n\n", "short_description": "PICKABOOM IS A MULTIPLAYER MINER SHOOTER FEATURING SPACE MINERS, MASSIVE ENVIRONMENTS, AND ENDLESS HORDES OF ALIEN MONSTERS. EXPLORE CAVE SYSTEMS, MINE FOR MINERALS, AND WORK TOGETHER TO SURVIVE!\n\nJOIN THE DISCORD \ud83d\udc49 [https://discord.com/invite/pickaboom](https://discord.com/invite/pickaboom)"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pi